    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■Stage Direction\nSE: Murmurs\n---\n★Request\nOguri Cap walks into frame, changed into a jersey.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■Stage Direction\nSatisfied sigh\n---\n★Request\nTamamo Cross walks out of frame.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■Stage Direction\nSE: Stomach growling",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★Request\nOguri walks into frame to where Tamamo Cross is.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■Stage Direction\nGender: Female\nAge: 3rd Year Middle School\nPersonality: Cheerful, spirited",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★Request\nFade to black.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★Request\nTamamo Cross runs into frame.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★Request\nOguri Cap and Tamamo Cross walk out of frame.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■Stage Direction\nSoliloquy",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Mmh... I ended up right back here again...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "No, it's just... back home, I was never surrounded\r\nby so many girls around my own age, so...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "It is awfully noisy.\nIs there a festival starting here, perhaps?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "M-Man, you really are a piece of work...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "A few days after guiding the lost Oguri Cap,\r\nI spotted her wandering around the academy with a troubled look once again...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I am not used to it, so lately I have been eating meals in my room—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Aha, there ya are, Oguri! Attagirl,\r\nyou finally went and memorized the way to the track!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Really?! We finally get to see Oguri Cap's speed\nup close and personal! Let's go, let's go!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Tama... You are fast, too. More than I expected.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Wait, whoa! Look at that massive crowd!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Heh, you bet I am! But next time,\nI'm gonna blow your expectations way outta the water.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Oguri Cap's opponent for the mock race\r\nwas Tamamo Cross, a powerhouse Umamusume who had already debuted.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "It is a very strange... yet pleasant sensation.\nCould this be... excitement...?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": ".........",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hey, sorry to keep ya waitin', Oguri!\r\nI'm all set to roll...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Well, if you get nervous,\r\njust picture all their faces as giant takoyaki!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I see. So this is the Central League's—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "You are... from the other day.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Right now... my heart won't stop racing.\r\nWhenever I recall that race earlier, it just starts pounding.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Since I am not used to it... it makes me restless.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...It is a rather curious feeling. My heart is supposedly strong,\r\nso it usually settles down right after a race, but...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Yes, I know the way.\nThe Trainer guided me the entire way, after all.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "The distance was 800 meters. Their powerful strides tore into the turf.\nNeither was willing to give an inch...!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I was worried ya'd get lost, but hey—it ain't like I can guide\r\nya everywhere. Figured bein' a bit strict would pay off—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Let's do that. I'll go get ready.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Excuse me, could you give me directions again?\nI need to get to the training course.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Oh... Were you watching?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Ah, whatever, don't matter now.\nC'mon, let's get this mock race rollin'!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Alright, me too!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "The rumor spread across the academy in an instant—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "\"Takoyaki\"... I see. Understood.\r\nI'll give it a try.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Oh... Is that so?\nTo think this many Umamusume would come...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Oguri...! Heh, we're just gettin' started!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Mmh...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ngh...!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ah, Tama...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "And with that, Oguri Cap and\nTamamo Cross's mock race finally began...!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I'll show ya what Naniwa grit's all about!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "It was the same during meals... Whenever I piled my plate high with food,\r\nI inevitably drew attention...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "A rival...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "So ya went and brought 'em anyway, huh?!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Oguri Cap stood there for a long time,\nas if savoring the lingering afterglow...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—Alright, now I'm all fired up!\r\nThink I'll go for a run outside. Catch ya later, Oguri!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hm? What's up, Oguri? Gettin' cold feet?\r\nYa'll never make it in a GⅠ race like that, y'know~!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting, Tama.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Tamamo-senpai and that transfer student\nare about to run a mock race over there!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "The two constantly traded the lead back and forth, and then—!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hah...!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": ".........I've started to get hungry.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I guided Oguri Cap to the track.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Haa, hah...! Dead heat, same time, huh...\r\nNot bad at all, Oguri.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hm...?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    }
  ],
  "no_wrap": true
}